PART 1: PERSONA 1 — RAMESH PATIL (TRADITIONAL FARMER) Device: Mobile App (iOS / Android Frame)
Screen 1.1: Home Dashboard
Header: App Title "Shetkari Mitra", Language Switcher Toggle (Marathi / EN), and Audio notification icon.
Field Selector: Dropdown card showing Gat No. 42 - Sugarcane (Plot B).
Soil Moisture Card: Clean progress bar showing 78% Soil Moisture with an explicit badge: Optimal / पुरेसा ओलावा.
Advisory Box: High-contrast block with text: "No irrigation needed tonight. Rain expected." and a prominent button: [ Listen Audio / ऐका ].
Quick Status: Pump motor indicator showing OFF (Standby).
Bottom Navigation Bar (Interactive): Tabs for [Home], [Pump Control], [Voice], [Reports]. Clicking [Pump Control] transitions smoothly to Screen 1.2.
Screen 1.2: Pump Control & Power Sync
Header: Back button + Title Power & Pump Sync.
Grid Status Card: MSEDCL 3-Phase Active (Available until 06:00 AM).
Automation Toggles: Switches for Auto-shutoff at 80% moisture and Run only during night power slots.
Manual Override: Large centered physical-style button: [ PUMP OFF ].
Navigation: Clicking [Voice] in the bottom bar transitions to Screen 1.3.
Screen 1.3: Marathi Voice Assistant
Header: Title Voice Assistant (शेतकरी संवाद).
Chat Stream: Right-aligned user bubble ("उसाला पुढचे पाणी कधी देऊ?") and left-aligned system response card ("Soil moisture is 78%. Pumping tonight wastes electricity.") with an audio play button.
Action Area: Large circular microphone button with sub-label: Tap & Speak / दाबा आणि बोला.
Navigation: Clicking [Reports] transitions to Screen 1.4.
Screen 1.4: Usage & Savings Report
Header: Title Monthly Usage & Savings.
Metrics Row: Two cards showing Electricity Saved: Rs. 1,420 (-28%) and Pump Run Time: -18 Hours.
Chart: Clean 4-week bar chart tracking stable moisture percentage above 70%.
Primary CTA: Full-width button: [ Download Mill Verification PDF ]. Clicking [Home] returns to Screen 1.1.
PART 2: PERSONA 2 — PRIYA SHARMA (AGRICULTURAL EXTENSION OFFICER) Device: Desktop / Tablet Dashboard (1440px Web View)
Screen 2.1: Cluster Overview & Alerts
Top Bar: Portal title Shetkari Mitra | Officer Console, location Village A (Sangli District), and user profile Priya Sharma.
KPI Header Strip: 142 Plots Monitored, 5 Over-Irrigated Plots (Action Needed), 137 Optimal Plots.
Grid Area: 6 plot summary cards displaying farmer names, moisture levels, and explicit tags ([FLAG: WATERLOGGED]). Each card has a clickable [View Details] link that routes to Screen 2.3.
Sidebar Navigation: Links for [Overview], [Filter Plots], [Farm Diagnostics], [Mill Reports]. Clicking [Filter Plots] routes to Screen 2.2.
Screen 2.2: Plot Filter & Spatial Map View
Header: Title Plot Filter & Health Tracking.
Filter Bar: Dropdowns for Moisture Level (>80%), Soil Type (Black Soil), Irrigation Method, and Power Group.
Split View: Left list of flagged plots with checkboxes; Right GIS parcel map showing highlighted over-irrigated plot boundaries.
Action Button: [ Schedule Field Visits ].
Screen 2.3: Farm Diagnostic & Sucrose Correlation
Header: Back link + Title Field Diagnostic: Ramesh Patil (Plot B).
Split Chart Section:
Left Card: 14-day soil moisture line graph tracking above the 80% safe threshold line.
Right Card: Correlated line graph showing predicted Sucrose Recovery Drop (-1.8%) vs cane payout risk.
Action Footer: Advisory note and a button: [ Log Advice & Reset Threshold ].
Screen 2.4: Sugar Mill Compliance & Export Report
Header: Title Village A - Monthly Mill Summary Report.
Compliance Table: Columns for Plot ID, Farmer Name, Avg Soil Moisture, and Recovery Grade (A/B/C).
Analytics: Village irrigation compliance bar chart for the last 3 weeks.
Export Section: Dropdown for report period and a primary button: [ Export Verification PDF for Sugar Mill ].
